-- One-time data update: Park City Run gets a new layout.
--
-- Its own layout and opening (Moses, 15 Nov 2026: the World Tour re-layouts):
-- until now it was physically the same track as Dubai Twister. A rolling start
-- down from the summit lift station (the field let go in waves) and a wide
-- first turn, S-bends through the aspens, the hairpin by the elk, into the
-- timbered mine tunnel and down the old silver mine's shaft (the big feature
-- and new signature: a long steep drop), the terrain-park run, the spiral and
-- Main Street. Its name, slug, look and past races stay. Its track record,
-- country records and players' personal bests start again from now
-- (tracks.records_since); past results stay. Races already run keep their
-- stored replays and play back exactly as they ran.
--
-- Generated from src/game/physicsTracks.js by scripts/physics-track-sql.js --relayout.
-- Only the Park City Run track row changes.

